### 首批真实契约；先执行迁移并启动新版后端，填写自己的 token / deptId
@base = http://127.0.0.1:48080/admin-api
@tenant = 1
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@storeId = REPLACE_WITH_SYSTEM_DEPT_ID
@employeeId = REPLACE_WITH_EMPLOYEE_ID
@fileId = REPLACE_WITH_FILE_ID

### 列表（关联选项每页最多 200 条）
GET {{base}}/gym/stores?pageNo=1&pageSize=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 创建门店：不传 deptId 则新建部门；可传 parentDeptId 指定总部部门
POST {{base}}/gym/stores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"TEST-A","name":"联调门店 A","description":"测试资料","areaSqm":"500.00","features":["私教"],"address":"测试地址","businessHours":{"opens":"06:00","closes":"23:00"},"status":"active"}

### 详情
GET {{base}}/gym/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 部分更新
PATCH {{base}}/gym/stores/{{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"更新后的简介"}

### 媒体整体替换（文件须提前上传到同一门店，类别 image/video）
PUT {{base}}/gym/stores/{{storeId}}/media
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"fileId":"{{fileId}}","caption":"环境照片","isCover":true,"sortOrder":0}]}

### 创建员工档案；可选 userId 关联已有账号，须 system:user:update 且账号部门等于主门店
POST {{base}}/gym/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"employeeNo":"TEST-E001","name":"联调员工","phone":"13800000000","jobTitle":"教练","hiredOn":"2026-10-13","status":"active","storeAssignments":[{"storeId":"{{storeId}}","isPrimary":true,"isManager":false,"joinedOn":"2026-10-13"}]}

### 授权门店员工分页
GET {{base}}/gym/employees?pageNo=1&pageSize=20&storeId={{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 员工详情
GET {{base}}/gym/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}

### 部分更新
PATCH {{base}}/gym/employees/{{employeeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{tenant}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"jobTitle":"门店教练"}
